@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# Billing disputes
+
+`classifyBillingQuestion` in `/src/billing.ts` owns the current billing classification. A message containing the exact lowercase text `refund` is classified as `refund-review`; every other message is classified as `invoice-question`.
+
+The fallback is an implementation detail, not evidence that every non-refund message is an invoice question. The `support` agent applies this classification only to refund and invoice questions. A `refund-review` classification requires human review and is not a promise that a refund will be approved. For an `invoice-question`, support answers only from available project evidence and states when human review is needed.

